  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tamil Nadu Empowerment and Poverty Reduction</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective would be to empower the poor and improve livelihoods through: (a) developing and strengthening pro-poor local institutions/groups (including Village Panchayats); (b) building skills and capacities of the poor; and (c) financing productive demand-driven sub-project investments.</narrative>
  </description>
